  "idea": "Automated holiday and time-off calendar sync across distributed teams",
  "text": "This automated tool syncs local country holidays and approved PTO directly into Slack profiles. Global teams constantly ping teammates across different time zones only to discover they are completely offline. These broken communication loops delay client approvals and disrupt asynchronous handoffs across multiple regions. Connecting Timetastic to Slack automatically updates user statuses, mutes notifications, and routes incoming tickets elsewhere. Your team respects personal boundaries while maintaining continuous delivery.",
